    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates is delighted to present No. 29 Kilmore Crescent, an impressive 3-bedroom, semi-detached family home complete with a floored attic room and a rear single-storey extension. Maintained in excellent condition throughout, this turnkey property is perfect for growing families.\r\nThe location offers unbeatable convenience. Nestled in a vibrant neighborhood, it sits within easy walking distance of Artane Castle Shopping Centre and Beaumont Hospital. Excellent local schools, shops, and parks are right on your doorstep. Commuters will love the fast access to Dublin City Centre via several frequent bus routes, while the nearby M1 and M50 motorways make traveling further afield effortless.\r\nAccommodation includes: Entrance porch, hallway, guest W.C., living room, dining room, kitchen, and an extended family room. Upstairs features 3 bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a large, versatile floored attic space.\r\nOutside: A clean cobble-lock front driveway connects to a shared side driveway, leading down to a rear garage. The property boasts a generous, west-facing rear garden extending approximately 56 feet—ideal for catching the evening sun. Viewing comes highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n\t\t\r\nEntrance Hall\t4.1m x 2m\tWith alarm control panel, dado rail and under stirs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C. \t\tW.C.  WHB.  Wall paneling and tiled floor. \r\n\r\nLiving Room\t4.4m x 4m\tWith an attractive open feature fire place with a Waterford Stanley Stove inset.  Double doors through to:-\r\n\r\nDining Room\t4m x 3.2m \tArchway through to:-\r\n\r\nExtended Family Room\t3.5m x 2.6m \tWith a pitched pine roof, recessed lights, 4 velux windows and double doors to the West facing rear garden.\r\n \r\nKitchen\t3.6m x 3m\tWith fitted wall and floor units, oven, hob and extractor fan.  Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding\t\tShelved hot press.  Stairs to floored attic room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1)\t4m x 3.2m\tWith fitted wardrobes and presses.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2)\t4.4m x 3.6m\tWith coved ceiling.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3)\t3.15m x 2.1m\tWith fitted wardrobes.  Coved ceiling.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\tWith a large shower tray an glass screen, electric shower unit, W.C.  WHB.  Fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nFloored Attic Room \t5.3m x 4.8m\tLarge floored attic room with fitted wardrobes, 3 velux windows and under eaves storage.\r\n\r\nOutside\t\tThere is clean cobble-lock front driveway connecting to a shared side driveway, leading down to a rear garage and access to the back garden The property boasts a generous, west-facing rear garden extending approximately 56 feet—ideal for catching the evening sun."
      },
